sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS supports HTTPS file transfer protocol
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: A diagnostics logging server has been set up for HTTPS<br>and accepts specific userinfo credentials
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration: CSMS configured to prevent unauthorised uploading to HTTPS log location

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger CSMS to GetLogRequest with logType DiagnosticsLog<br>and remoteLocation with userinfo for HTTP Basic Authentication

    CSMS->>CS: GetLogRequest (logType = DiagnosticsLog, log.remoteLocation with userinfo)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: logType must be DiagnosticsLog<br>log.remoteLocation must contain a valid URL,<br>specify scheme HTTPS,<br>contain userinfo for HTTP Basic Authentication,<br>not contain a URL fragment component,<br>not contain a URL query components that ends in a slash character ("/")
    CS-->>CSMS: GetLogResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: HTTP POST upload log file (to GetLogRequest.log.remoteLocation of step 1)
    CSMS-->>CS: HTTP response
    Note over CSMS: Validation: HTTP status code must be 401 Unauthorized

    CS->>CSMS: HTTP POST upload file (to GetLogRequest.log.remoteLocation of step 1)
    CSMS-->>CS: HTTP response
    Note over CSMS: Validation: HTTP status code must be in 2xx-range

    CS->>CSMS: LogStatusNotificationRequest (status = Uploading, requestId = GetLogRequest.requestId of step 1)
    CSMS-->>CS: LogStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: LogStatusNotificationRequest (status = Uploaded, requestId = GetLogRequest.requestId of step 1)
    CSMS-->>CS: LogStatusNotificationResponse
